PART C -- reparametrisation invariance: the frame is a gauge, not a choice
==========================================================================
  [PASS] C1 [REPARAMETRISATION INVARIANCE] under T -> f(T) the physical metric
      and the constraint are UNCHANGED: g^{mu nu} d_mu T d_nu T = -1 still
